    "text": "syvnews.com\nwebsite\nSanta Maria\nSt. Joseph has top area girls sports program for 2024-25 school year\nBy Kenny Cress kcress@santamariatimes.com,\n4 hours agoThe St. Joseph girls athletic program got enough big points from enough teams to strike gold among area girls programs when it came to the 2024-25 school year. The soccer, basketball and stunt teams all scored big and helped propel the Knights to a repeat Times gold medal standing among girls area sports programs for the latest academic year. St. Joseph amassed 87.3 points to 70 for runner-up Santa Ynez, which earned the silver medal. Third-place Orcutt Academy took the bronze with 65 points.\n2",
